# Automatic detection of design 8.4 step 1, "Engineering sets impulse engines to 0
# and warp engines to 200". Previously this step had no detector at all - only the
# engineering_impulse_zero_warp_200_requested flag, which records that the runtime
# ASKED for it, not that Engineering did it. Design 8.4's stated detection priority
# is "ship motion / engine output / damage / repair: automatic where possible".
